  "body": "Easy-care living, peaceful surroundings and a quality lifestyle come together in this beautifully updated ground-floor, single level apartment.\r\n\r\nPositioned on the corner of a secure gated complex, this light-filled home enjoys beautiful park views from your own private, gated patio, a peaceful spot for a morning coffee or to simply sit back and enjoy the surroundings.\r\n\r\nInside, the hard work has already been done. New flooring, an updated kitchen and bathroom, give the home a modern, comfortable feel that's ready to move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nA dedicated car park is included, with additional shared parking available within the complex.\r\n\r\nThe well-maintained complex adds even more to the lifestyle, with a swimming pool, tennis court, pétanque court, playground and plenty of open space for kids to play.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer looking to get on the property ladder, downsizing to something more manageable, or searching for the ultimate lock-up-and-leave, this is an easy home to own and enjoy.\r\n\r\nA Lifestyle Location:\r\n\r\nGulf Harbour Marina is a short walk away, with popular cafés, restaurants, bars and shops lining the waterfront.\r\n\r\nBeautiful beaches are just minutes away, while Shakespear Regional Park offers picturesque walking trails, stunning coastal scenery. Some of the Peninsula's best outdoor experiences right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nFor commuters or those wanting easy access to the city, the nearby ferry service offers a convenient and scenic journey into Auckland. Skip the traffic and enjoy a peaceful trip across the harbour — a genuine lifestyle advantage.\r\n\r\nLight-filled, low-maintenance and surrounded by everything that makes Gulf Harbour such a special place to live — lock up, leave and enjoy.",
